    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Exclusive breastfeeding has been demonstrated to reduce the incidence of childhood asthma,\" revealed Dr Naseeruddin Mahmood, Consultant Paediatrician, the Aga Khan University (AKU). He was speaking at the First Childhood Asthma Seminar and Workshop held at AKU on Wednesday May 3, 2000.",
